      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HELLO PECK (1) took the sit on the lead from an outside box but levelled up and drew clear to score (29.23) at Wentworth Park in a NG over 520m. Winner at his latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Great chance to get the job done again. FASCINATE SAMUEL (2) has missed the frame at his last couple of starts but just a few runs back broke the clock when winning over 520m at Wentworth Park, taking a Grade 4/5 in an exceptional 29.62. Should be in this for a long way. MY PHARAOH (3) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 6 length win at The Gardens in a handy 22.74. Fair draw can see a good run and likes the trip. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Leading chance again. DENNIS KEEPING (5) is in the mix after placing as favourite last time out.",
